-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-635 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c2166473866-635 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-635"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-635 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-635"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-635">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-635"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-635 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_16bddd0154b4bc11" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_16bddd0154b4bc11" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">没问题！最好的学习方式就是<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="13">模拟真实场景</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">我们来模拟一个**“电商商品搜索系统”**。这个案例非常经典，因为它涵盖了文本搜索（搜名字）、精确筛选（选品牌）、范围查询（价格区间）和数据统计（价格分布），刚好对应我之前列出的核心知识点。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">请打开你的 <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="6">Kibana Dev Tools</b> (或者 Postman)，跟随以下 4 个步骤操作。</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">第一步：创建索引与 Mapping (设计表结构)</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">这一步是为了掌握<b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="8">数据类型</b>和<b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="13">映射</b>。</p><ul data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0">我们将 <code data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="4">name</code> (商品名) 设为 <code data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="18">text</code>，因为需要分词搜索（例如搜“手机”能搜到“智能手机”）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0">我们将 <code data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="4">brand</code> (品牌) 设为 <code data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="18">keyword</code>，因为品牌需要精确匹配和聚合统计，不需要分词。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="7"><b data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="0">请复制并运行以下代码：</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-658 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-658 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_16bddd0154b4bc11&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_bafc2e1365f85805&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ-gY" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-658 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-658">JSON</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-658 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-658 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_16bddd0154b4bc11&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_bafc2e1365f85805&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-658"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-658"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-658"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-658">PUT /my_shop
