尝试修改<b data-path-to-node="39" data-index-in-node="14">场景 2</b> 的查询语句：</p><blockquote data-path-to-node="40"><p data-path-to-node="40,0">找出所有的 <b data-path-to-node="40,0" data-index-in-node="6">"Laptop" (笔记本电脑)</b>，或者标签 (<code data-path-to-node="40,0" data-index-in-node="29">tags</code>) 里包含 <b data-path-to-node="40,0" data-index-in-node="39">"5g"</b> 的商品，并且按 <b data-path-to-node="40,0" data-index-in-node="52">价格从低到高</b> 排序。</p></blockquote><p data-path-to-node="41">如果你能写出这个 Query，说明你第二阶段（应用篇）已经基本通关了！需要我公布答案吗？</p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3454274491-633"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1927598164="" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-649 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1927598164-649 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="spacer ng-tns-c1927598164-649 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-649"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-649"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-