e="3">s -&gt; s.query(...)</code> 这种 <b data-path-to-node="11,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="24">Lambda 表达式</b>。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="11,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">依赖包</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="11,2,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="11,2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">elasticsearch-rest-high-level-client</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="11,2,2,0"><code data-path-to-node="11,2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">elasticsearch-java</code></span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="11,3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">结果解析</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="11,3,1,0">常用 <code data-path-to-node="11,3,1,0" data-index-in-node="3">hit.getSourceAsMap()</code> 拿到 Map 再手动转。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="11,3,2,0">支持直接传入 <code data-path-to-node="11,3,2,0" data-index-in-node="7">Class</code> (如 <code data-path-to-node="11,3,2,0" data-index-in-node="16">Product.class</code>) 自动反序列化。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="11,4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">现状</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="11,4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">已废弃 (Deprecated)</b>，但在维护旧项目时最常见。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="11,4,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">官方推荐</b>，类型更安全，代码更简洁。</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制表格" aria-label="复制表格" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetad