51;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-711"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-711">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-711"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-711 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_a3168757b8caf04f" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_a3168757b8caf04f" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0"><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0">答案是：可以使用，但有明显的性能局限。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="1">在 Elasticsearch 7.x 中使用向量功能，主要依赖 <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="33">dense_vector</code> 字段类型配合 <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="53">script_score</code> 查询。这是一种**暴力计算（Brute Force）**的方式，与 ES 8.x 引入的 <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="111">HNSW（近似最近邻搜索）</b> 有本质区别。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">以下是 7.x 版本向量搜索的核心机制与代码实现。</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">1. 核心机制：Script Score (脚本算分)</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">在 ES 7.x 中，向量搜索的原理是：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">存储：</b> 使用 <code data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="7">dense_vector</code> 类型存储向量数据。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">查询：</b> 使用 <code data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="7">script_score</code> 遍历每一个文档，计算查询向量与文档向量的相似度（如余弦相似度 <code data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="51">cosineSimilarity</code>）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">缺点：</b> 因为要扫描所有文档（或者 Filter 后的所有文档），<b data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="32">速度随数据量增加而线性下降</b>。数据量超过几十万级时，响应会变慢。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="7"><h3 data-path-to-node="8">2. 第一步：创建索引 (Mapping)</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">你必须在 Mapping 中显式定义向量字段的维度 (<code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="27">dims</code>)。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-725 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-725 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a3168757b8caf04f&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1814a00c0085ffc5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ2Qc" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-725 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-725">JSON</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-725 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-725 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a3168757b8caf04f&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1814a00c0085ffc5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-725"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-725"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-725"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-725">PUT /my_vector_index
{
  <span class="hljs-attr">"mappings"</span>: {
    <span class="hljs-attr">"properties"</span>: {
      <span class="hljs-attr">"name"</span>: { <span class="hljs-attr">"type"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"keyword"</span> },
      <span class="hljs-attr">"my_vector"</span>: {
        <span class="hljs-attr">"type"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"dense_vector"</span>,
        <span class="hljs-attr">"dims"</span>: <span class="hljs-number">4</span>  <span class="hljs-comment">// 你的向量维度，例如 BERT 模型通常是 768，这里用 4 演示</span>
      }
    }
  }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="11">3. 第二步：插入带向量的数据</h3><p data-path-to-node="12">插入数据时，向量就是一个浮点数数组。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-726 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-726 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a3168757b8caf04f&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1814a00c0085ffc5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ2gc" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-726 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-726">JSON</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-726 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-726 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a3168757b8caf04f&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1814a00c0085ffc5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-726"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-726"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-726"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-726">POST /my_vector_index/_doc/<span class="hljs-number">1</span>
