4491-728"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-730 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c2166473866-730 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-730"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-730 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-730"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-730">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-730"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-730 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_0672ff6459413b93" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_0672ff6459413b93" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这两者都是在原有数据库基础上，通过<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="17">插件（Extension/Module）</b> 的方式来“外挂”向量搜索能力的。这与 Elasticsearch 8.x 原生内置向量引擎略有不同。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">下面我分别介绍它们的实现原理和代码写法。</p><hr data-path-to-node="2"><h3 data-path-to-node="3">1. PostgreSQL：通过 <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="17">pgvector</code> 插件</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">PostgreSQL 是目前最受推崇的<b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="19">混合型</b>向量数据库方案。因为它成熟、稳定，且能完美支持 <b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="46">“关系型数据筛选 + 向量相似度搜索”</b>（例如：在 1000 万条数据中，先筛选 <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="86">user_id=100</code>，再做向量搜索）。</p><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">核心原理：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">插件机制：</b> 官方推荐使用开源插件 <code data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="17">pgvector</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">存储：</b> 引入了一种新的数据类型 <code data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="16">vector(dim)</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">索引：</b> 支持 <b data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="7">IVFFlat</b> (倒排文件) 和 <b data-path-to-node="6,2,0" data-index-in-node="24">HNSW</b> (图索引，性能更好) 两种索引。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">计算：</b> 引入了特殊的 SQL 操作符，如 <code data-path-to-node="6,3,0" data-index-in-node="21">&lt;-&gt;</code> (欧氏距离), <code data-path-to-node="6,3,0" data-index-in-node="33">&lt;=&gt;</code> (余弦距离)。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="7"><b data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="0">代码实现 (SQL 风格):</b></p><p data-path-to-node="8"><b data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="0">1. 安装与建表</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-761 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-761 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b527f7b770fcdf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQgQg" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-761 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-761">SQL</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-761 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-761 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b527f7b770fcdf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-761"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-761"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-761"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-761"><span class="hljs-comment">-- 1. 启用插件 (只需执行一次)</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> EXTENSION vector;

<span class="hljs-comment">-- 2. 创建表，定义一个 3 维的向量字段</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">TABLE</span> items (
    id bigserial <span class="hljs-keyword">PRIMARY</span> KEY,
    name <span class="hljs-type">varchar</span>(<span class="hljs-number">100</span>),
    embedding vector(<span class="hljs-number">3</span>)  <span class="hljs-comment">-- 关键在这里</span>
);

<span class="hljs-comment">-- 3. 创建 HNSW 索引 (推荐，速度快)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">-- opclass 这里的 vector_cosine_ops 表示优化余弦相似度</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">CREATE</span> INDEX <span class="hljs-keyword">ON</span> items <span class="hljs-keyword">USING</span> hnsw (embedding vector_cosine_ops);
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="10"><b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="0">2. 插入数据</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-762 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-762 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b527f7b770fcdf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQggg" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-762 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-762">SQL</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-762 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-762 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b527f7b770fcdf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-762"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-762"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-762"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-762"><span class="hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">INTO</span> items (name, embedding) <span class="hljs-keyword">VALUES</span> 
(<span class="hljs-string">'Apple'</span>, <span class="hljs-string">'[1, 1, 1]'</span>),
(<span class="hljs-string">'Banana'</span>, <span class="hljs-string">'[2, 2, 2]'</span>),
(<span class="hljs-string">'Dog'</span>, <span class="hljs-string">'[10, 10, 10]'</span>);
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="12"><b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="0">3. 向量查询</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-763 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-763 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b527f7b770fcdf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQgwg" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-763 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-763">SQL</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-763 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-763 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b527f7b770fcdf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-763"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-763"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-763"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-763"><span class="hljs-comment">-- 查找与 [1, 1, 1.2] 最相似的 5 个商品</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">-- &lt;=&gt; 操作符代表 "余弦距离"</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> name, embedding 
<span class="hljs-keyword">FROM</span> items 
<span class="hljs-keyword">ORDER</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">BY</span> embedding <span class="hljs-operator">&lt;=&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-string">'[1, 1, 1.2]'</span> 
LIMIT <span class="hljs-number">5</span>;
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><blockquote data-path-to-node="14"><p data-path-to-node="14,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,0" data-index-in-node="0">评价：</b> 对开发者极其友好，因为不需要引入新组件，就在现有的 Postgres 里加个字段即可，非常适合作为初创项目的首选。</p></blockquote><hr data-path-to-node="15"><h3 data-path-to-node="16">2. Redis：通过 <code data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="12">RediSearch</code> 模块</h3><p data-path-to-node="17">Redis 本身是 Key-Value 数据库，不支持复杂的搜索。但通过安装 <b data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="39">Redis Stack</b>（或者手动加载 <code data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="58">RediSearch</code> 模块），它就变成了一个<b data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="80">极速</b>的内存向量数据库。</p><p data-path-to-node="18"><b data-path-to-node="18" data-index-in-node="0">核心原理：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="19"><li><p data-path-to-node="19,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="19,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">内存计算：</b> 所有向量数据和索引都常驻内存，速度极快（毫秒级甚至微秒级），但成本高。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="19,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">数据结构：</b> 使用 Hash 或 JSON 存储数据，并在其上建立 Index。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="19,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">算法：</b> 同样支持 HNSW（适合大数据）和 FLAT（暴力计算，适合小数据）。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="20"><b data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="0">代码实现 (Redis CLI / Jedis 风格):</b></p><p data-path-to-node="21"><b data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="0">1. 创建索引</b>
Redis 的写法比较特殊，需要使用 <code data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="27">FT.CREATE</code> 命令。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-764 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-764 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b527f7b770fcdf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhAg" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-764 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-764">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-764 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-764 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b527f7b770fcdf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-764"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-764"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-764"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-764"><span class="hljs-comment"># 创建一个名为 my_idx 的索引</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># ON HASH: 基于 Hash 数据结构</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># PREFIX 1 item:: 索引所有 key 以 "item:" 开头的数据</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># SCHEMA: 定义字段，embedding 字段类型为 VECTOR</span>
FT.CREATE my_idx ON HASH PREFIX 1 item: SCHEMA \
  name TEXT \
  embedding VECTOR HNSW 6 TYPE FLOAT32 DIM 3 DISTANCE_METRIC COSINE
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="23"><b data-path-to-node="23" data-index-in-node="0">2. 插入数据</b>
即普通的 Hash 写入（HSET）。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-765 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-765 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b527f7b770fcdf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhQg" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-765 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-765">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-765 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-765 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b527f7b770fcdf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-765"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-765"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-765"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-765"><span class="hljs-comment"># 这里的向量数据通常需要转为二进制 blob，CLI 演示比较麻烦，这里示意</span>
HSET item:1 name <span class="hljs-string">"Apple"</span> embedding <span class="hljs-string">"\x00\x00\x80\x3f..."</span> 
HSET item:2 name <span class="hljs-string">"Banana"</span> embedding <span class="hljs-string">"\x00\x00\x00\x40..."</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="25"><b data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="0">3. 向量查询 (KNN)</b>
使用 <code data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="17">FT.SEARCH</code> 命令。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-766 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-766 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b527f7b770fcdf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhgg" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-766 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-766">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-766 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-766 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b527f7b770fcdf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-766"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-766"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-766"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-766"><span class="hljs-comment"># 搜索名为 my_idx 的索引</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># 查询最相似的 5 个结果 (K=5)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># =&gt; [KNN 5 @embedding $query_vec]</span>
FT.SEARCH my_idx <span class="hljs-string">"*=&gt;[KNN 5 @embedding <span class="hljs-variable">$query_vec</span>]"</span> \
  PARAMS 2 query_vec <span class="hljs-string">"\x00\x00\x80\x3f..."</span> \
  DIALECT 2
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><blockquote data-path-to-node="27"><p data-path-to-node="27,0"><b data-path-to-node="27,0" data-index-in-node="0">评价：</b> <b data-path-to-node="27,0" data-index-in-node="4">快</b>是它最大的优势。非常适合用于<b data-path-to-node="27,0" data-index-in-node="19">实时推荐系统</b>（如用户刷抖音，下一条推什么），或者<b data-path-to-node="27,0" data-index-in-node="43">对话系统的短期记忆</b>。但因为全内存存储，如果你的向量有几亿条，光内存费用就非常惊人。</p></blockquote><hr data-path-to-node="28"><h3 data-path-to-node="29">三者对比总结：ES vs PG vs Redis</h3><p data-path-to-node="30">既然你正在学 Elasticsearch，我列一个对比表帮你理清思路：</p><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c3726268734="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" class="table-block has-export-button"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhwg"><table data-path-to-node="31"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="31,0,0,0">特性</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,0,1,0">Elasticsearch (8.x)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,0,2,0">PostgreSQL (pgvector)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,0,3,0">Redis (RediSearch)</span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="31,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">定位</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">搜索引擎 + 向量</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">关系数据库 + 向量</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,1,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">缓存/内存库 + 向量</b></span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="31,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">核心优势</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">全文检索最强</b>。适合需要同时搜文本（倒排索引）和搜向量（KNN）的场景。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,2,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">运维成本最低</b>。如果你的业务数据本来就在 PG 里，直接加个插件就能用，不用同步数据。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,2,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,2,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">速度最快</b>。全内存操作，延迟极低，适合高并发实时场景。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="31,3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">数据规模</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,3,1,0">亿级以上（分布式天生支持）</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,3,2,0">千万级（单机瓶颈，分库分表复杂）</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,3,3,0">百万/千万级（受限于内存价格）</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="31,4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">典型场景</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,4,1,0">文档知识库 (RAG)、电商搜索</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,4,2,0">传统业务系统的 AI 增强</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,4,3,0">实时推荐、广告点击预测</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="31,5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">学习难度</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,5,1,0">中等 (DSL)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,5,2,0">低 (SQL)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="31,5,3,0">中等 (命令复杂)</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制表格" aria-label="复制表格" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0672ff6459413b93&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><h3 data-path-to-node="32">建议</h3><ul data-path-to-node="33"><li><p data-path-to-node="33,0,0">如果你主要做<b data-path-to-node="33,0,0" data-index-in-node="6">搜索业务</b>（比如搜商品、搜文档），并且已经决定用 Elasticsearch，那就直接用 <b data-path-to-node="33,0,0" data-index-in-node="50">ES 8.x</b> 的向量功能，不要引入新的数据库，架构最简单。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="33,1,0">如果你只是做一个简单的 AI 小工具，数据都在数据库里，用 <b data-path-to-node="33,1,0" data-index-in-node="30">PostgreSQL</b> 最省事。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="34">你现在手头的项目更偏向哪种场景？是重搜索，还是重业务逻辑？</p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3454274491-728"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1927598164="" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-752 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1927598164-752 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="spacer ng-tns-c1927598164-752 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-752"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-752"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c413749340="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c413749340="" class="conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-inserted" id="879667b4c463fce8" style=""><user-query _ngcontent-ng-c413749340="" _nghost-ng-c4073444889="" class="ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c4073444889="" class="user-query-