iv _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-769"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-769 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-769"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-769">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-769"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-769 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_879667b4c463fce8" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_879667b4c463fce8" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0"><b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0">答案是非常明确的：不是。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="1">这两个数据库的原生旧版本都不直接支持向量功能。它们都是随着 AI 热潮，通过引入**插件（Extension）<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="55">或</b>模块（Module）**才具备了这项能力。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">如果你在公司里使用的是几年前安装的老数据库，大概率是不能直接用的。</p><p data-path-to-node="3">以下是详细的版本要求和避坑指南：</p><hr data-path-to-node="4"><h3 data-path-to-node="5">1. PostgreSQL：需要 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="17">pgvector</code> 插件</h3><p data-path-to-node="6">PostgreSQL 本身（即便是最新的 v16/v17）<b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="29">内核并没有内置</b>向量字段类型。它是完全依赖开源社区的插件 <b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="57"><code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="57">pgvector</code></b> 来实现的。</p><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">版本门槛：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="7,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">PostgreSQL 11 +</b>：你的 Postgres 数据库版本必须至少是 11 或更高。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">pgvector 版本</b>：建议使用 <code data-path-to-node="7,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="17">v0.5.0</code> 以上版本（因为 v0.5 才引入了 HNSW 索引，之前的版本只有 IVFFlat，速度慢且难维护）。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">如何检查你是否能用？</b>
在你的数据库里执行以下 SQL：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-786 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-786 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_879667b4c463fce8&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_480a956a39eda532&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQpAg" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-786 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-786">SQL</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-786 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-786 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_879667b4c463fce8&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_480a956a39eda532&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-786"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-786"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-786"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-786"><span class="hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> version(); <span class="hljs-comment">-- 查看 PG 版本</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> <span class="hljs-operator">*</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">FROM</span> pg_available_extensions <span class="hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> name <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> <span class="hljs-string">'pgvector'</span>; <span class="hljs-comment">-- 查看是否有插件</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="7,1,2">如果第二条命令查不到数据，说明你没安装这个插件，需要手动安装（<code data-path-to-node="7,1,2" data-index-in-node="31">apt-get install postgresql-14-pgvector</code> 或自行编译）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">云数据库避坑（阿里云/AWS/腾讯云）：</b>
很多云厂商的旧版 RDS for PostgreSQL 是不支持安装第三方插件的。你必须购买<b data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="67">较新的版本</b>（通常是 2023 年以后的实例），或者专门的“向量数据库版”实例。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="8"><h3 data-path-to-node="9">2. Redis：需要 <code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="12">RediSearch</code> 模块 (Redis Stack)</h3><p data-path-to-node="10">标准的 Redis（就是你平时只用来做缓存的那个）是<b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="26">不支持</b>向量的。必须加载 <code data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="38">RediSearch</code> 模块。</p><p data-path-to-node="11">为了方便开发者，Redis 官方推出了一个打包版本叫 <b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="27">Redis Stack</b>，它集成了 Redis 核心 + 向量搜索 + JSON 处理等所有高级功能。</p><ul data-path-to-node="12"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">版本门槛：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="12,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,0,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Redis Core</b>：底层通常需要 Redis 6.x 或 7.x。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,0,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Redis Stack</b>：这是最推荐的方式。直接安装 <code data-path-to-node="12,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="26">redis-stack-server</code> 而不是 <code data-path-to-node="12,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="49">redis-server</code>。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">如何检查你是否能用？</b>
连接到 Redis 执行命令：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-787 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-787 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_879667b4c463fce8&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_480a956a39eda532&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQpQg" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-787 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-787">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-787 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-787 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_879667b4c463fce8&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_480a956a39eda532&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-787"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-787"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-787"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-787">MODULE LIST
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="12,1,2">如果你在返回列表中看不到 <code data-path-to-node="12,1,2" data-index-in-node="13">search</code> (即 RediSearch)，那你的 Redis 就不支持向量搜索。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">严重避坑（Windows 用户）：</b>
Redis 官方早就停止支持 Windows 原生版本了（网上下载的 Windows 版 Redis 通常是很老的 3.x 或 5.x 微软特供版）。
<b data-path-to-node="12,2,0" data-index-in-node="94">一定要用 Docker 安装 Redis Stack</b>，不要试图在 Windows 上直接找安装包。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="13"><h3 data-path-to-node="14">总结对照表</h3><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c3726268734="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" class="table-block has-export-button has-scrollbar"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQpgg"><table data-path-to-node="15"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="15,0,0,0">数据库</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="15,0,1,0">能否直接用向量?</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="15,0,2,0">必须安装的组件</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="15,0,3,0">最低核心版本要求</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="15,0,4,0">推荐配置</span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="15,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">PostgreSQL</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="15,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">不能</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="15,1,2,0">插件 <code data-path-to-node="15,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="3">pgvector</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="15,1,3,0">PostgreSQL <b data-path-to-node="15,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="11">11+</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="15,1,4,0">PG 15 + pgvector v0.7</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="15,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Redis</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="15,2,1,0"><b dat