r"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_8550e154756c5ae3" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_8550e154756c5ae3" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一份为你精心准备的 <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="12">docker-compose.yml</code> 文件。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">它集成了 <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="5">Elasticsearch (8.x)</b>、<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="25">Kibana</b>、<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="32">PostgreSQL (带 pgvector)</b> 和 <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="58">Redis Stack (带向量功能)</b>。这就是一个完整的“AI 向量搜索学习全家桶”，一键启动，无需单独安装任何软件。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="2">📂 docker-compose.yml</h3><p data-path-to-node="3">请在你的电脑上新建一个文件夹（例如 <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="18">ai-learning</code>），在里面创建一个名为 <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="41">docker-compose.yml</code> 的文件，并将以下内容复制进去：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-803 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-803 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_8550e154756c5ae3&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f35b92d072d8ace1&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQuwg" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-803 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-803">YAML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-803 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-803 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_8550e154756c5ae3&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f35b92d072d8ace1&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-803"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-803"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-803"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-803"><span class="hljs-attr">version:</span> <span class="hljs-string">'3.8'</span>

<span class="hljs-attr">services:</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># ---------------------------------------------------------------</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># 1. Elasticsearch 8.x (搜索引擎 + 向量数据库)</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># ---------------------------------------------------------------</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">es:</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">image:</span> <span class="hljs-string">docker.elastic.co/elasticsearch/elasticsearch:8.11.1</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">container_name:</span> <span class="hljs-string">es-node</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">environment:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">discovery.type=single-node</span>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 单机模式</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">ES_JAVA_OPTS=-Xms512m</span> <span class="hljs-string">-Xmx512m</span>    <span class="hljs-comment"># 限制内存，防止电脑卡死</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">xpack.security.enabled=false</span>      <span class="hljs-comment"># 【重要】关闭安全验证，学习时免去配置账号密码/SSL的麻烦</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">ports:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">"9200:9200"</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">volumes:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">es_data:/usr/share/elasticsearch/data</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">networks:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">ai-net</span>

  <span class="hljs-comment"># ---------------------------------------------------------------</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># 2. Kibana (ES 的可视化界面)</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># ---------------------------------------------------------------</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">kibana:</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">image:</span> <span class="hljs-string">docker.elastic.co/kibana/kibana:8.11.1</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">container_name:</span> <span class="hljs-string">kibana</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">ports:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">"5601:5601"</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">environment:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">ELASTICSEARCH_HOSTS=http://es:9200</span> <span class="hljs-comment"># 连接到 ES 容器</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">depends_on:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">es</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">networks:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">ai-net</span>

  <span class="hljs-comment"># ---------------------------------------------------------------</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># 3. PostgreSQL + pgvector (关系型数据库 + 向量插件)</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># ---------------------------------------------------------------</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">postgres:</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">image:</span> <span class="hljs-string">ankane/pgvector:latest</span>  <span class="hljs-comment"># 使用预装了 pgvector 的镜像</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">container_name:</span> <span class="hljs-string">pg-vector</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">environment:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">POSTGRES_USER=postgres</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">POSTGRES_PASSWORD=secret</span>   <span class="hljs-comment"># 你的数据库密码</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">POSTGRES_DB=vectordb</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">ports:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">"5432:5432"</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">volumes:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">pg_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">networks:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">ai-net</span>

  <span class="hljs-comment"># ---------------------------------------------------------------</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># 4. Redis Stack (内存数据库 + 向量模块 + 可视化UI)</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># ---------------------------------------------------------------</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">redis:</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">image:</span> <span class="hljs-string">redis/redis-stack:latest</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">container_name:</span> <span class="hljs-string">redis-stack</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">ports:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">"6379:6379"</span>  <span class="hljs-comment"># Redis 端口</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">"8001:8001"</span>  <span class="hljs-comment"># RedisInsight UI 界面端口</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">volumes:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">redis_data:/data</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">networks:</span>
      <span class="hljs-bullet">-</span> <span class="hljs-string">ai-net</span>

<span class="hljs-comment"># 定义数据卷 (防止重启后数据丢失)</span>
<span class="hljs-attr">volumes:</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">es_data:</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">pg_data:</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">redis_data:</span>

<span class="hljs-comment"># 定义网络 (让容器之间互通)</span>
<span class="hljs-attr">networks:</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">ai-net:</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">driver:</span> <span class="hljs-string">bridge</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="5"><h3 data-path-to-node="6">🚀 如何启动</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0">打开终端（CMD / PowerShell / Terminal），进入该文件所在的目录。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0">运行启动命令：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-804 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-804 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_8550e154756c5ae3&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f35b92d072d8ace1&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQvAg" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-804 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-804">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-804 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-804 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_8550e154756c5ae3&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f35b92d072d8ace1&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-804"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-804"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-804"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-804">docker-compose up -d
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="7,1,2"><i data-path-to-node="7,1,2" data-index-in-node="0">(第一次运行会下载镜像，可能需要几分钟，取决于网速)</i></p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="8"><h3 data-path-to-node="9">✅ 启动后如何验证？</h3><p data-path-to-node="10">启动成功后，你可以通过浏览器访问以下地址来检查环境是否就绪：</p><p data-path-to-node="11"><b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="0">1. Elasticsearch</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="12"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">地址：</b> <code data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="4">http://localhost:9200</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">预期：</b> 看到一个 JSON 返回，里面有 <code data-path-to-node="12,1,0" data-index-in-node="21">"tagline": "You Know, for Search"</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">注意：</b> 我在配置里关闭了密码验证 (<code data-path-to-node="12,2,0" data-index-in-node="18">xpack.security.enabled=false</code>)，所以你的 Java 代码连接时<b data-path-to-node="12,2,0" data-index-in-node="63">不需要</b>配置用户名密码，也不需要 SSL 证书，非常方便学习。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="13"><b data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="0">2. Kibana (ES 界面)</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="14"><li><p data-path-to-node="14,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">地址：</b> <code data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="4">http://localhost:5601</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">操作：</b> 进入后点击左侧菜单的 <code data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="15">Dev Tools</code>，就可以开始写 DSL 了。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="15"><b data-path-to-node="15" data-index-in-node="0">3. RedisInsight (Redis 可视化界面)</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="16"><li><p data-path-to-node="16,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="16,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">地址：</b> <code data-path-to-node="16,0,0" data-index-in-node="4">http://localhost:8001</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="16,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">预期：</b> 看到 Redis 管理界面。在这里你可以直接看到之后写入的向量索引和 Key。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="17"><b data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="0">4. PostgreSQL</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="18"><li><p data-path-to-node="18,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">连接工具：</b> 使用 DBeaver 或 IDEA Database 工具连接。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="18,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Host:</b> <code data-path-to-node="18,1,0" data-index-in-node="6">localhost</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="18,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Port:</b> <code data-path-to-node="18,2,0" data-index-in-node="6">5432</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="18,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">User:</b> <code data-path-to-node="18,3,0" data-index-in-node="6">postgres</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="18,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Password:</b> <code data-path-to-node="18,4,0" data-index-in-node="10">secret</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="18,5,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,5,0" data-index-in-node="0">Database:</b> <code data-path-to-node="18,5,0" data-index-in-node="10">vectordb</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="18,6,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,6,0" data-index-in-node="0">验证插件：</b> 连接后执行 SQL: <code data-path-to-node="18,6,0" data-index-in-node="17">CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS vector;</code> 如果不报错，说明成功。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="19"><h3 data-path-to-node="20">💡 内存警告</h3><p data-path-to-node="21">这个全家桶同时启动了 4 个服务。虽然我限制了 ES 的内存，但建议你的电脑至少有 <b data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="42">8GB 以上内存</b>（推荐 16GB）。如果觉得电脑卡，可以只注释掉你暂时不用的 <code data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="81">service</code>（在行首加 <code data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="94">#</code>），然后重新 <code data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="102">up -d</code>。</p><p data-path-to-node="22">快去试试吧！如果有报错，把错误信息发给我。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3454274491-790"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1927598164="" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-798 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1927598164-798 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="spacer ng-tns-c1927598164-798 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-798"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-798"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngco