><p data-path-to-node="0">没问题！既然你已经有了 Docker 环境，我们直接上代码。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">为了让代码既专业又易懂，我选择了目前 Java 社区最主流的连接方式：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">PostgreSQL</b>: 使用官方 JDBC 驱动 + <code data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="27">pgvector-java</code> 工具库（官方推荐，处理向量最方便）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Redis</b>: 使用 <code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="10">Jedis</code> 5.0+（老牌驱动，对 Redis Stack 的搜索模块支持最好）。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">第一部分：PostgreSQL + pgvector Java 案例</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">这个案例将演示：建表 -&gt; 插入向量数据 -&gt; 向量相似度查询（KNN）。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="6">1. Maven 依赖</h4><p data-path-to-node="7">在 <code data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="2">pom.xml</code> 中添加：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-853 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-853 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_bdf30f369db1bf70&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4d10b3a2ba1effe4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQggk" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-853 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-853">XML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-853 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-m