uot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4d10b3a2ba1effe4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-854"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-854"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-854"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-854"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> com.pgvector.PGvector;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> java.sql.*;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> java.util.Arrays;

<span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">PgVectorDemo</span> </span>{

    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">static</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(String[] args)</span> </span>{
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 连接到 Docker 中的 Postgres</span>
        String url = <span class="hljs-string">"jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/vectordb"</span>;
        String user = <span class="hljs-string">"postgres"</span>;
        String password = <span class="hljs-string">"secret"</span>;

        <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> (Connection conn = DriverManager.getConnection(url, user, password)) {
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 初始化环境</span>
            Statement stmt = conn.createStatement();
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 启用插件 (如果 Docker 里已经启用了，这句可跳过)</span>
            stmt.execute(<span class="hljs-string">"CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS vector"</span>);
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 建表 (注意 embedding 字段类型为 vector(3))</span>
            stmt.execute(<span class="hljs-string">"DROP TABLE IF EXISTS items"</span>);
            stmt.execute(<span class="hljs-string">"CREATE TABLE items (id bigserial PRIMARY KEY, name varchar(50), embedding vector(3))"</span>);
            
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 为向量字段创建 HNSW 索引 (加速查询)</span>
            stmt.execute(<span class="hljs-string">"CREATE INDEX ON items USING hnsw (embedding vector_cosine_ops)"</span>);

            System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"--- 表结构初始化完成 ---"</span>);

            <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 插入数据 (Insert)</span>
            String insertSQL = <span class="hljs-string">"INSERT INTO items (name, embedding) VALUES (?, ?)"</span>;
            <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> (PreparedStatement pstmt = conn.prepareStatement(insertSQL)) {
                <span class="hljs-comment">// 插入第一条: Apple [1, 1, 1]</span>
                pstmt.setString(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"Apple"</span>);
                pstmt.setObject(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>, <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> PGvector(<span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">float</span>[] {<span class="hljs-number">1f</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1f</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1f</span>}));
                pstmt.addBatch();

                <span class="hljs-comment">// 插入第二条: Banana [2, 2, 2]</span>
                pstmt.setString(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"Banana"</span>);
                pstmt.setObject(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>, <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> PGvector(<span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">float</span>[] {<span class="hljs-number">2f</span>, <span class="hljs-number">2f</span>, <span class="hljs-number">2f</span>}));
                pstmt.addBatch();

                <span class="hljs-comment">// 插入第三条: Dog [10, 10, 10] (离得远)</span>
                pstmt.setString(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"Dog"</span>);
                pstmt.setObject(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>, <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> PGvector(<span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">float</span>[] {<span class="hljs-number">10f</span>, <span class="hljs-number">10f</span>, <span class="hljs-number">10f</span>}));
                pstmt.addBatch();

                pstmt.executeBatch();
            }
            System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"--- 数据插入完成 ---"</span>);

            <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 向量搜索 (Vector Search)</span>
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 目标：找离 [1, 1, 1.2] 最近的商品</span>
            <span class="hljs-comment">// &lt;=&gt; 表示余弦距离 (Cosine Distance)</span>
            String searchSQL = <span class="hljs-string">"SELECT name, embedding, embedding &lt;=&gt; ? as distance FROM items ORDER BY distance LIMIT 3"</span>;
            
            <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> (PreparedStatement pstmt = conn.prepareStatement(searchSQL)) {
                <span class="hljs-comment">// 设置查询向量</span>
                pstmt.setObject(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> PGvector(<span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">float</span>[] {<span class="hljs-number">1f</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1f</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1.2f</span>}));
                
                ResultSet rs = pstmt.executeQuery();
                <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> (rs.next()) {
                    String name = rs.getString(<span class="hljs-string">"name"</span>);
                    <span class="hljs-keyword">double</span> distance = rs.getDouble(<span class="hljs-string">"distance"</span>);
                    <span class="hljs-comment">// 获取存进去的向量</span>
                    PGvector vec = (PGvector) rs.getObject(<span class="hljs-string">"embedding"</span>);
                    
                    System.out.printf(<span class="hljs-string">"商品: %-10s | 距离: %.4f | 向量: %s%n"</span>, 
                            name, distance, Arrays.toString(vec.toArray()));
                }
            }

        } <span class="hljs-keyword">catch</span> (SQLException e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
        }
    }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="11"><h3 data-path-to-node="12">第二部分：Redis Stack (RediSearch) Java 案例</h3><p data-path-to-node="13">Redis 的代码相对复杂一些，因为 Redis 底层存储向量需要转为<b data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="35">二进制字节数组</b>。Jedis 5.0 封装得比较好了，但仍需理解 <code data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="67">FT.CREATE</code> 和 <code data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="79">FT.SEARCH</code> 命令。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="14">1. Maven 依赖</h4><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-855 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-855 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_bdf30f369db1bf70&quot;,&quot;c_5449f3519d0d8e03&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4d10b3a2ba1effe4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwiU8tXn5c6RAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhAk" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-855 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-855">XML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-855 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-m